                                "sense_id": "73c4005d-4580-3f1d-afb9-7ad0412f2691",
                                "text": "Him so transfixed she before her bore / Beyond his croupe, the length of all her launce; / Till, sadly soucing on the sandy shore, / He tombled on an heape, and wallowd in his gore."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "35cf8468-b835-4082-8bf0-a8bb2197bac5",
                                "sense_id": "73c4005d-4580-3f1d-afb9-7ad0412f2691",
                                "text": "Thus on some silver swan or tim'rous hare / Jove's bird comes sowsing down from upper air"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
