                                "sense_id": "94530946-6776-3281-af3e-ffa651ce647d",
                                "text": "(Although I bee well soused in this showere,)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "40199ed7-d146-459b-a701-5c08ac77c91d",
                                "sense_id": "94530946-6776-3281-af3e-ffa651ce647d",
                                "text": "For then I viewd his body fall and ſowſe / Into the fomy maine, […]"
                            },
