                                "example_id": "344b0888-646a-4ce6-974e-845833501cbe",
                                "sense_id": "94530946-6776-3281-af3e-ffa651ce647d",
                                "text": "As for my ſelf, they uſed to ſowſe me over head and ears in water when I was a boy"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5afda12-9489-4b5a-9e03-32435e47072d",
                                "sense_id": "94530946-6776-3281-af3e-ffa651ce647d",
                                "text": "As she heard him sousing heartily in cold water, heard the eager scratch of the steel comb on the side of the bowl, as he wetted his hair, she closed her eyes in disgust."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
